"text-align: justify; line-height: 12.0pt; margin: 0cm 3.0pt .0001pt 3.0pt;\">\n<span>Clothing</span>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 12.0pt; margin: 0cm 3.0pt .0001pt 3.0pt;\">\n<span>Role</span>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 12.0pt; margin: 0cm 3.0pt .0001pt 3.0pt;\">\n<span>Rubber</span>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 12.0pt; margin: 0cm 3.0pt .0001pt 3.0pt;\">\n<span>Some Plastics</span>\n</p>\n </td> <td style=\"width: 172.5pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 33.0pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"345\"> \n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 12.0pt; margin: 0cm 3.0pt .0001pt 3.0pt;\">\n<span> ? ? The water is used for purposes in cooling.</span>\n</p>\n </td> </tr> <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 2; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; height: 20.25pt;\"> <td style=\"width: 89.25pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 20.25pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"179\"> \n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 12.0pt; margin: 0cm 3.0pt .0001pt 3.0pt;\">\n<span>Class B</span>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: normal; margin: 0cm 3.0pt .0001pt 3.0pt;\">\n</a><!-- [if mso & !supportInlineShapes & supportFields]><span lang=ES-PA style=\'mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin; mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family: \"Times New Roman\";mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:ES-PA; mso-fareast-language:EN-US\'><span style=\'mso-spacerun:yes\'> ? </span>SHAPE \\* MERGEFORMAT <![endif]--><!-- [if mso & !supportInlineShapes & supportFields]><span lang=ES-PA style=\'mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin; mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-bidi-font-family: \"Times New Roman\";mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;mso-ansi-language:ES-PA; mso-fareast-language:EN-US\'><v:shape id=\"_x0000_i1025\" type=\"#_x0000_t75\" style=\'width:.85pt;height:.85pt\'> <v:imagedata croptop=\"-65520f\" cropbottom=\"65520f\"/> </v:shape><![endif]-->\n</p>\n </td> <td style=\"width: 155.25pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 20.25pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"311\"> \n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 12.0pt; margin: 0cm 3.0pt .0001pt 3.0pt;\">\n<span>Fires involving:</span>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 12.0pt; margin: 0cm 3.0pt .0001pt 3.0pt;\">\n<span> ? Flammable Liquids</span>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 12.0pt; margin: 0cm 3.0pt .0001pt 3.0pt;\">\n<span> ? Fat</span>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 12.0pt; margin: 0cm 3.0pt .0001pt 3.0pt;\">\n<span> ? Gases</span>\n</p>\n </td> <td style=\"width: 172.5pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 20.25pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"345\"> \n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 12.0pt; margin: 0cm 3.0pt .0001pt 3.0pt;\">\n<span> ? ? Effect of suffocation by excluding oxygen.</span>\n</p>\n </td> </tr> </tbody> </table> \n\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: 150%;\">\n<strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span>3.12<span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\"> ? ? ? ? </span>Consideration fires</span></strong>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 12.0pt; mso-outline-level: 1;\">\n<strong><span>FIRE CLASS C</span></strong>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 12.0pt; mso-outline-level: 1;\">\n<span>Fires involving energized electrical equipment.</span>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 12.0pt;\">\n<span>Such fires can be controlled by a nonconductive suppressant. ? The security procedure is to try to de-energize the high voltage circuits and treating it as a Class A or B fire, depending on the fuel involved.</span><img src=\"@@PLUGINFILE@@/image%20%287%29.png\">\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 12.0pt; mso-outline-level: 1;\">\n<strong><span>CLASS D FIRE</span></strong>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 12.0pt;\">\n<span>Fires involving combustible metals such as magnesium, titanium, zirconium, sodium and potassium. ? High temperatures of some metals in combustion cause water and other common extinguish ants be ineffective. ? An agent that effectively controls all types of fires in combustible metals is not available. ? There are special extinguishing agents for fire control for each of the metals and are specifically identified for that metal.</span>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 12.0pt;\">\n<span><img src=\"@@PLUGINFILE@@/image%20%288%29.png\"></span>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 12.0pt; mso-outline-level: 1; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 70.0pt;\">\n</a><!-- [if mso & !supportInlineShapes & supportFields]><span lang=EN-US><span style=\'mso-spacerun:yes\'> ? </span>SHAPE \\* MERGEFORMAT <![endif]--> <!-- [if mso & !supportInlineShapes & supportFields]><span lang=EN-US><v:shape id=\"_x0000_i1030\" type=\"#_x0000_t75\" style=\'width:.85pt; height:.85pt\'> <v:imagedata croptop=\"-65520f\" cropbottom=\"65520f\"/> </v:shape><![endif]-->\n</p>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n <table class=\"Tablaconcuadrcula1\" style=\"width: 417.75pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" border=\"1\" width=\"836\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"> <tbody> <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; height: 20.25pt;\"> <td style=\"width: 89.25pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 20.25pt;\" valign=\"top\" nowrap=\"nowrap\" width=\"179\"> \n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 12.0pt; margin: 0cm 3.0pt .0001pt 3.0pt;\">\n</a><span>Fire</span>\n</p>\n </td> <td style=\"width: 155.25pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 20.25pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"311\"> \n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 12.0pt; margin: 0cm 3.0pt .0001pt 3.0pt;\">\n<span>Material Types</span>\n</p>\n </td> <td style=\"width: 172.5pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-left: none; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 20.25pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"345\"> \n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 12.0pt; margin: 0cm 3.0pt .0001pt 3.0pt;\">\n<span>Method of Extinction</span>\n</p>\n </td> </tr> <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; height: 25.5pt;\"> <td style=\"width: 89.25pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 25.5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"179\"> \n<p style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 12.0pt; margin: 0cm 3.0pt .0001pt 3.0pt;\">\n<span>Class C</span>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: ju